ure enough, it's quite unoptimized.\r\n\r\nBelow are some GDScript benchmarks of the current master, dev build, 100k runs - I timed various strings against the empty string case.\r\n\r\n**--- Invalid colors ---**\r\n2 digits: 0.4ms\r\n2 digits with #: 37.8ms\r\n9 digits: 0.5ms\r\n9 digits with #: 37.5ms\r\n8 digits, bad char on pos 2: 5.9ms\r\n8 digits with #, bad char on pos 2: 50.3ms\r\n8 digits, bad char on pos 8: 24.3ms\r\n8 digits with #, bad char on pos 8: 64.7ms\r\n10000 digits: 0.9ms\r\n10000 digits with #: 288ms\r\n\r\n**--- Valid colors ---**\r\n3 digits: 2.4ms\r\n3 digits with #: 42ms\r\n4 digits: 11.6ms\r\n4 digits with #: 52.7ms\r\n6 digits: 17.4ms\r\n6 digits with #: 57.5ms\r\n8 digits: 23.8ms\r\n8 digits with #: 63.6ms\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nWith this PR, all of them took 0.2-0.5ms.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-01T09:13:30Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T09:46:51Z","closed_at":"2025-04-01T09:44:23Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fc87987964a6e3c9bceffa68838d46b25567d02c","assignee":nul